        Doc       : (alternate use: see same field in :ref:`NXsubentry` for preferred) Official
                    NeXus NXDL schema to which this entry conforms which must be the name of the
                    NXDL file (case sensitive without the file extension) that the NXDL schema is
                    defined in. For example the ``definition`` field for a file that conformed to
                    the *NXarpes.nxdl.xml* definition must contain the string **NXarpes**. This
                    field is provided so that :ref:`NXentry` can be the overlay position in a NeXus
                    data file for an application definition and its set of groups, fields, and
                    attributes. *It is advised* to use :ref:`NXsubentry`, instead, as the overlay
                    position.
